#. ja: サポートすっぴん
#. de: Phantom-Freiberufler
#. fr: Freelance fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Freelancer
#. column 3: Reminiscences of journeys just begun and those long ended embody the freelancer's myriad supportive techniques.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Freelancer:0"
msgid "Phantom Freelancer"
msgstr "Фантомный вольный стрелок"

#. ja: Ph. Freelancer
#. de: Ph-Freiberufler
#. fr: Freelance fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Freelancer
#. column 3: Reminiscences of journeys just begun and those long ended embody the freelancer's myriad supportive techniques.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Freelancer:1"
msgid "Ph. Freelancer"
msgstr "Фант. вольный стрелок"

#. ja: ある冒険者の出発点にして終着点の記憶。\n探索に便利なサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: In dieser Erinnerung stecken die bescheidenen Anfänge bis zum glorreichen Ende eines alten Abenteurers. Außerdem lauter Kniffe, die beim Erkunden äußerst nützlich sind.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un aventurier libre comme l'air vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions taillées sur mesure pour l'exploration.
#. column 0: Phantom Freelancer
#. column 1: Ph. Freelancer
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Freelancer:3"
msgid "Reminiscences of journeys just begun and those long ended embody the freelancer's myriad supportive techniques."
msgstr "Воспоминания о начале и конце пути одного вольного стрелка хранят множество полезных при исследовании приёмов."

#. ja: サポートナイト
#. de: Phantom-Ritter
#. fr: Paladin fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Knight
#. column 3: Emulate these ancient memories of a loyal, honorable knight and defend your comrades from harm.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Knight:0"
msgid "Phantom Knight"
msgstr "Фантомный рыцарь"

#. ja: Ph. Knight
#. de: Ph-Ritter
#. fr: Paladin fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Knight
#. column 3: Emulate these ancient memories of a loyal, honorable knight and defend your comrades from harm.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Knight:1"
msgid "Ph. Knight"
msgstr "Фант. рыцарь"

#. ja: ある騎士の忠誠心と名誉の記憶。\n味方の被害を減らすサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Treue und Ehre prägen diese alte Erinnerung eines noblen Ritters. Mit ihr lassen sich Mitstreiter vielseitig schützen und vor Schaden bewahren.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un paladin honorable et dévoué vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions qui vous permettront de protéger vos alliés.
#. column 0: Phantom Knight
#. column 1: Ph. Knight
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Knight:3"
msgid "Emulate these ancient memories of a loyal, honorable knight and defend your comrades from harm."
msgstr "Воспроизведите воспоминания о верном и благородном рыцаре, чтобы защитить товарищей от опасности."

#. ja: サポートバーサーカー
#. de: Phantom-Berserker
#. fr: Berserker fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Berserker
#. column 3: Savagery and unfailing courage characterize the recollections of this former berserker. These techniques entail great risk and even greater reward.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Berserker:0"
msgid "Phantom Berserker"
msgstr "Фантомный берсерк"

#. ja: Ph. Berserker
#. de: Ph-Berserker
#. fr: Berserker fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Berserker
#. column 3: Savagery and unfailing courage characterize the recollections of this former berserker. These techniques entail great risk and even greater reward.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Berserker:1"
msgid "Ph. Berserker"
msgstr "Фант. берсерк"

#. ja: ある狂戦士の蛮勇と熱狂の記憶。\nハイリスクハイリターンなサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Erinnerungen an Zorn und Mut prägen diesen einstigen Berserker. Seine Techniken zahlen sich durch hohes Risiko mit entsprechend hoher Belohnung aus.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un berserker téméraire et fougueux vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions aussi risquées que destructrices.
#. column 0: Phantom Berserker
#. column 1: Ph. Berserker
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Berserker:3"
msgid "Savagery and unfailing courage characterize the recollections of this former berserker. These techniques entail great risk and even greater reward."
msgstr "Воспоминания бывшего берсерка полны ярости и отваги. Его приёмы сопряжены с большим риском, но и награда за них велика."

#. ja: サポートモンク
#. de: Phantom-Mönch
#. fr: Moine fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Monk
#. column 3: These memories of a monk's unflinching discipline and quiet meditation offer a path to unparalleled combat mastery.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Monk:0"
msgid "Phantom Monk"
msgstr "Фантомный монах"

#. ja: Ph. Monk
#. de: Ph-Mönch
#. fr: Moine fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Monk
#. column 3: These memories of a monk's unflinching discipline and quiet meditation offer a path to unparalleled combat mastery.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Monk:1"
msgid "Ph. Monk"
msgstr "Фант. монах"

#. ja: ある僧侶の修行と瞑想の記憶。\n攻撃に長けたサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Übung und Meditation sind das, was in der Erinnerung dieses Mönchs stecken. Man wird kaum einen geschickteren Angreifer als diesen edlen Krieger finden.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un moine méditatif et assidu vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions offensives décisives.
#. column 0: Phantom Monk
#. column 1: Ph. Monk
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Monk:3"
msgid "These memories of a monk's unflinching discipline and quiet meditation offer a path to unparalleled combat mastery."
msgstr "Воспоминания о непоколебимой дисциплине и спокойной медитации монаха откроют путь к непревзойдённому мастерству в бою."

#. ja: サポート狩人
#. de: Phantom-Jäger
#. fr: Rôdeur fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Ranger
#. column 3: Channel these memories of a proud, passionate ranger and learn to call forth the forces of nature in battle.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Ranger:0"
msgid "Phantom Ranger"
msgstr "Фантомный следопыт"

#. ja: Ph. Ranger
#. de: Ph-Jäger
#. fr: Rôdeur fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Ranger
#. column 3: Channel these memories of a proud, passionate ranger and learn to call forth the forces of nature in battle.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Ranger:1"
msgid "Ph. Ranger"
msgstr "Фант. следопыт"

#. ja: ある狩人の誇りと慈愛の記憶。\n動物たちの力を借りるサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Mit Stolz und Leidenschaft schoss dieser Jäger seine Pfeile, wie diese alte Erinnerung verrät. Mit ihr macht man sich die vielseitigen Talente verschiedener Tiere zu Eigen.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un rôdeur fier et passionné vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions puisant dans les forces de la nature.
#. column 0: Phantom Ranger
#. column 1: Ph. Ranger
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Ranger:3"
msgid "Channel these memories of a proud, passionate ranger and learn to call forth the forces of nature in battle."
msgstr "Воспользуйтесь воспоминаниями о гордом и пылком следопыте, чтобы призывать в бою силы природы."

#. ja: サポート侍
#. de: Phantom-Samurai
#. fr: Samouraï fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Samurai
#. column 3: Rigorous training and a strict code of chivalry personify these recollections of an ancient samurai. Access them to fell foes in a single deadly strike.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Samurai:0"
msgid "Phantom Samurai"
msgstr "Фантомный самурай"

#. ja: Ph. Samurai
#. de: Ph-Samurai
#. fr: Samouraï fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Samurai
#. column 3: Rigorous training and a strict code of chivalry personify these recollections of an ancient samurai. Access them to fell foes in a single deadly strike.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Samurai:1"
msgid "Ph. Samurai"
msgstr "Фант. самурай"

#. ja: ある侍の武士道と鍛錬の記憶。\n一撃必殺のサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Der Weg des Samurai ist von einem starken Geist geprägt, wie diese Erinnerung deutlich macht. Sie lehrt, Feinde mit einem einzigen Streich zu besiegen.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un samouraï discipliné et respectueux de la voie du guerrier vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions soudaines et mortelles.
#. column 0: Phantom Samurai
#. column 1: Ph. Samurai
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Samurai:3"
msgid "Rigorous training and a strict code of chivalry personify these recollections of an ancient samurai. Access them to fell foes in a single deadly strike."
msgstr "Воспоминания о суровых тренировках и строгом кодексе чести древнего самурая. Они научат сражаться так, чтобы одним смертельным ударом сразить врага."

#. ja: サポート吟遊詩人
#. de: Phantom-Barde
#. fr: Barde fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Bard
#. column 3: These memories echo with the vivid imagery of a bard's lilting song. Utilize them to employ the very same ballads in battle.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Bard:0"
msgid "Phantom Bard"
msgstr "Фантомный бард"

#. ja: Ph. Bard
#. de: Ph-Barde
#. fr: Barde fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Bard
#. column 3: These memories echo with the vivid imagery of a bard's lilting song. Utilize them to employ the very same ballads in battle.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Bard:1"
msgid "Ph. Bard"
msgstr "Фант. бард"

#. ja: ある吟遊詩人の詩想と熱唱の記憶。\n多彩な歌のサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Poesie, Gesang und die Liebe zur Kunst finden sich in der Erinnerung dieses alten Barden. Mit genau dieser Kunst können Gefährten vielseitig unterstützt werden.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un barde enthousiaste et poétique vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions tout en musique et chants.
#. column 0: Phantom Bard
#. column 1: Ph. Bard
#, aeria-term-model-exception: Echo a8596410ddf7
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Bard:3"
msgid "These memories echo with the vivid imagery of a bard's lilting song. Utilize them to employ the very same ballads in battle."
msgstr "В этих воспоминаниях звучат яркие мелодии барда. Воспользуйтесь ими, чтобы петь те же боевые баллады."

#. ja: サポート風水士
#. de: Phantom-Geomant
#. fr: Géomancien fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Geomancer
#. column 3: This geomancer's recollections brim with boundless understanding of nature's laws. Access them to employ weather-dependent techniques.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Geomancer:0"
msgid "Phantom Geomancer"
msgstr "Фантомный геомант"

#. ja: Ph. Geomancer
#. de: Ph-Geomant
#. fr: Géomancien fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Geomancer
#. column 3: This geomancer's recollections brim with boundless understanding of nature's laws. Access them to employ weather-dependent techniques.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Geomancer:1"
msgid "Ph. Geomancer"
msgstr "Фант. геомант"

#. ja: ある風水士の自然と理気の記憶。\n天候で効果が変わるサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Das Wissen der Naturgesetze und ein logischer Geist prägen diese geomantische Erinnerung. Sie lehrt, sich das Wetter optimal zunutze zu machen.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un géomancien versé dans les lois de l'univers vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions fluctuant avec la météo.
#. column 0: Phantom Geomancer
#. column 1: Ph. Geomancer
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Geomancer:3"
msgid "This geomancer's recollections brim with boundless understanding of nature's laws. Access them to employ weather-dependent techniques."
msgstr "Воспоминания геоманта хранят безграничные знания о законах природы. Воспользуйтесь ими, чтобы применять приёмы, сила которых зависит от погоды."

#. ja: サポート時魔道士
#. de: Phantom-Zeitmagier
#. fr: Chronomancien fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Time Mage
#. column 3: The memories of this former time mage reveal much about the laws of time and how to manipulate them to your advantage.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Time Mage:0"
msgid "Phantom Time Mage"
msgstr "Фантомный маг времени"

#. ja: Ph. Time Mage
#. de: Ph-Zeitmagier
#. fr: Chronomancien fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Time Mage
#. column 3: The memories of this former time mage reveal much about the laws of time and how to manipulate them to your advantage.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Time Mage:1"
msgid "Ph. Time Mage"
msgstr "Фант. маг времени"

#. ja: ある時魔道士の法則と定理の記憶。\n時間を操る時魔法のサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: In dieser Erinnerung schlummert das Wissen um die Gesetze der Zeit und wie diese zu beugen sind. Der Zeitmagier unterstützt Gefährten auf vielfältige und kreative Weise.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un chronomancien imperturbable et rigoureux vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions manipulant le temps à votre avantage.
#. column 0: Phantom Time Mage
#. column 1: Ph. Time Mage
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Time Mage:3"
msgid "The memories of this former time mage reveal much about the laws of time and how to manipulate them to your advantage."
msgstr "Воспоминания бывшего мага времени поведают о законах времени и научат обращать их себе на пользу."

#. ja: サポート砲撃士
#. de: Phantom-Grenadier
#. fr: Artilleur fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Cannoneer
#. column 3: A mastery of ballistics both scholarly and practical infuse this cannoneer's recollections. Emulate them to bombard foes with powerful projectiles.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Cannoneer:0"
msgid "Phantom Cannoneer"
msgstr "Фантомный артиллерист"

#. ja: Ph. Cannoneer
#. de: Ph-Grenadier
#. fr: Artilleur fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Cannoneer
#. column 3: A mastery of ballistics both scholarly and practical infuse this cannoneer's recollections. Emulate them to bombard foes with powerful projectiles.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Cannoneer:1"
msgid "Ph. Cannoneer"
msgstr "Фант. артиллерист"

#. ja: ある砲撃士の弾道学と戦術の記憶。\n様々な効果の弾を放つサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Komplexe Taktiken und schwere Ballistik zeichnen die Erinnerung dieses alten Grenadiers. Seine Geschosse unterstützen seinen Trupp mit allerlei Effekten.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un artilleur expert en tactique et balistique vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions aux munitions aussi effectives que variées.
#. column 0: Phantom Cannoneer
#. column 1: Ph. Cannoneer
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Cannoneer:3"
msgid "A mastery of ballistics both scholarly and practical infuse this cannoneer's recollections. Emulate them to bombard foes with powerful projectiles."
msgstr "Воспоминания артиллериста хранят глубокие теоретические и практические знания баллистики. Воспроизведите их, чтобы обрушить на врагов мощные снаряды."

#. ja: サポート薬師
#. de: Phantom-Alchemist
#. fr: Alchimiste fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Chemist
#. column 3: This chemist's memories offer knowledge of ancient medicinal theory, including restorative techniques sure to turn the tide of battle in your favor.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Chemist:0"
msgid "Phantom Chemist"
msgstr "Призрачный алхимик"

#. ja: Ph. Chemist
#. de: Ph-Alchemist
#. fr: Alchimiste fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Chemist
#. column 3: This chemist's memories offer knowledge of ancient medicinal theory, including restorative techniques sure to turn the tide of battle in your favor.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Chemist:1"
msgid "Ph. Chemist"
msgstr "Призр. алхимик"

#. ja: ある薬師の調合と薬効の記憶。\n高効果の薬品を用いたサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Die Erinnerung dieses alten Alchemisten besteht aus dem geschickten Mischen allerlei Tinkturen. Ihre potente Heilkraft ist ein mächtiges Werkzeug im Kampf.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un alchimiste virtuose des concoctions vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions tirant la quintessence de divers remèdes.
#. column 0: Phantom Chemist
#. column 1: Ph. Chemist
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Chemist:3"
msgid "This chemist's memories offer knowledge of ancient medicinal theory, including restorative techniques sure to turn the tide of battle in your favor."
msgstr "Воспоминания алхимика хранят знания древней медицины и целительных приёмов, которые помогут переломить ход битвы."

#. ja: サポート予言士
#. de: Phantom-Seher
#. fr: Devin fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Oracle
#. column 3: Endowed with an oracle's supernatural senses and prophetic insights, these memories promise mastery over a wealth of supportive skills.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Oracle:0"
msgid "Phantom Oracle"
msgstr "Призрачный оракул"

#. ja: Ph. Oracle
#. de: Ph-Seher
#. fr: Devin fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Oracle
#. column 3: Endowed with an oracle's supernatural senses and prophetic insights, these memories promise mastery over a wealth of supportive skills.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Oracle:1"
msgid "Ph. Oracle"
msgstr "Призр. оракул"

#. ja: ある予言士の霊感と啓示の記憶。\n時間差で効果が現れるサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: In den Erinnerungen dieses alten Sehers finden sich Inspiration und Prophezeiung. Eine mystische Macht, die selbst die Wogen der Zeit leiten kann.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un devin aux capacités de discernement surnaturelles vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions aux effets ultérieurs.
#. column 0: Phantom Oracle
#. column 1: Ph. Oracle
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Oracle:3"
msgid "Endowed with an oracle's supernatural senses and prophetic insights, these memories promise mastery over a wealth of supportive skills."
msgstr "Эти воспоминания наделены сверхъестественным чутьём оракула и даром предвидения. Они откроют множество полезных приёмов."

#. ja: サポートシーフ
#. de: Phantom-Dieb
#. fr: Voleur fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Thief
#. column 3: These recollections of a dextrous, principled thief grant access to survival techniques that will doubtless prove useful upon the isle.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Thief:0"
msgid "Phantom Thief"
msgstr "Призрачный вор"

#. ja: Ph. Thief
#. de: Ph-Dieb
#. fr: Voleur fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Thief
#. column 3: These recollections of a dextrous, principled thief grant access to survival techniques that will doubtless prove useful upon the isle.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Thief:1"
msgid "Ph. Thief"
msgstr "Призр. вор"

#. ja: ある盗賊の義侠心と特技の記憶。\n特殊な探索術を含むサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Geschick, Mut und allerlei Kniffe finden sich in der Erinnerung dieses Diebes. Sie liefert unverzichtbare Techniken zum Überleben und Erkunden in so gut wie jeder Umgebung.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un voleur rusé et généreux vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions subtiles et bigarrées pour tirer votre épingle du jeu.
#. column 0: Phantom Thief
#. column 1: Ph. Thief
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Thief:3"
msgid "These recollections of a dextrous, principled thief grant access to survival techniques that will doubtless prove useful upon the isle."
msgstr "Воспоминания о ловком и честном воре откроют приёмы, помогающие выжить. На острове они наверняка пригодятся."

#. ja: サポート魔法剣士
#. de: Phantom-Paladin
#. fr: Chevalier mage fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Mystic Knight
#. column 3: Suffused with a mystic knight's diligence and arcane prowess, these memories are key to imbuing your weaponry with potent magicks.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Mystic Knight:0"
msgid "Phantom Mystic Knight"
msgstr "Призрачный мистический рыцарь"

#. ja: Ph. Mystic Knight
#. de: Ph-Paladin
#. fr: Chevalier mage fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Mystic Knight
#. column 3: Suffused with a mystic knight's diligence and arcane prowess, these memories are key to imbuing your weaponry with potent magicks.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Mystic Knight:1"
msgid "Ph. Mystic Knight"
msgstr "Призр. мист. рыцарь"

#. ja: ある魔法剣士の研鑽と術技の記憶。\n武器に魔法を宿らせるサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Diese Erinnerung eines alten Paladins ist gefüllt von dessen Streben nach Wissen. Die in ihr enthaltenen magischen Künste erlauben es, alltägliche Waffen mit mächtigen Magien zu verstärken.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un chevalier mage dévoué et expert des arcanes vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions permettant d'enchanter votre épée.
#. column 0: Phantom Mystic Knight
#. column 1: Ph. Mystic Knight
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Mystic Knight:3"
msgid "Suffused with a mystic knight's diligence and arcane prowess, these memories are key to imbuing your weaponry with potent magicks."
msgstr "Воспоминания о старательном мистическом рыцаре, искусном в тайной магии, помогут наделить оружие могучими чарами."

#. ja: サポート剣闘士
#. de: Phantom-Gladiator
#. fr: Gladiateur fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Gladiator
#. column 3: This fierce, indomitable gladiator's recollections promise the mastery of myriad offensive and defensive skills.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Gladiator:0"
msgid "Phantom Gladiator"
msgstr "Призрачный гладиатор"

#. ja: Ph. Gladiator
#. de: Ph-Gladiator
#. fr: Gladiateur fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Gladiator
#. column 3: This fierce, indomitable gladiator's recollections promise the mastery of myriad offensive and defensive skills.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Gladiator:1"
msgid "Ph. Gladiator"
msgstr "Призр. гладиатор"

#. ja: ある剣闘士の戦いと不撓心の記憶。\n攻防兼ね備えた戦技のサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Ein unbeugsamer Wille ziert diese Erinnerung eines kampferfahrenen Gladiators. Offensive und defensive Techniken verschmelzen in ihr zu einer lückenlosen Kampfkunst.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un gladiateur inflexible et sans peur vous octroient la maîtrise d'un large éventail d'actions offensives et défensives.
#. column 0: Phantom Gladiator
#. column 1: Ph. Gladiator
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Gladiator:3"
msgid "This fierce, indomitable gladiator's recollections promise the mastery of myriad offensive and defensive skills."
msgstr "Воспоминания о свирепом, несгибаемом гладиаторе откроют множество атакующих и защитных приёмов."

#. ja: サポート踊り子
#. de: Phantom-Tänzer
#. fr: Danseur fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Dancer
#. column 3: Absorb the memories of an exalted, expressive dancer to replicate their deft footwork and bequeath yourself a range of boons.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Dancer:0"
msgid "Phantom Dancer"
msgstr "Призрачный танцор"

#. ja: Ph. Dancer
#. de: Ph-Tänzer
#. fr: Danseur fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Dancer
#. column 3: Absorb the memories of an exalted, expressive dancer to replicate their deft footwork and bequeath yourself a range of boons.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Dancer:1"
msgid "Ph. Dancer"
msgstr "Призр. танцор"

#. ja: ある踊り子の誇りと高揚の記憶。\n多彩な効果を生む踊りのサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Beschwingt und voller Stolz ist diese Erinnerung eines leidenschaftlichen Tänzers, dessen Schrittfolgen sich auch im Kampf als überaus nützlich erweisen.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un danseur expressif et raffiné vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions de danse aux effets divers et variés.
#. column 0: Phantom Dancer
#. column 1: Ph. Dancer
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Dancer:3"
msgid "Absorb the memories of an exalted, expressive dancer to replicate their deft footwork and bequeath yourself a range of boons."
msgstr "Впитайте воспоминания утончённого и выразительного танцора, перенимите его ловкие движения и обретите множество преимуществ."

#. ja: サポート忍者
#. de: Phantom-Ninja
#. fr: Ninja fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Ninja
#. column 3: These recollections of a ninja's stealth and stillness will prove useful in a great many precarious situations.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Ninja:0"
msgid "Phantom Ninja"
msgstr "Призрачный ниндзя"

#. ja: Ph. Ninja
#. de: Ph-Ninja
#. fr: Ninja fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Ninja
#. column 3: These recollections of a ninja's stealth and stillness will prove useful in a great many precarious situations.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Ninja:1"
msgid "Ph. Ninja"
msgstr "Призр. ниндзя"

#. ja: ある忍者の暗躍と忍耐の記憶。\nあらゆる場面で役立つ忍術のサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Diese Erinnerung ist bis zum Rand gefüllt mit den Geheimtechniken eines legendären Ninja. Gerade seine Fähigkeit, Doppelgänger von sich zu erzeugen, soll ihm mehr als einmal das Leben gerettet haben.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un ninja insaisissable et létal vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions efficaces en toute situation.
#. column 0: Phantom Ninja
#. column 1: Ph. Ninja
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Ninja:3"
msgid "These recollections of a ninja's stealth and stillness will prove useful in a great many precarious situations."
msgstr "Воспоминания о скрытном и невозмутимом ниндзя пригодятся во множестве опасных ситуаций."

#. ja: サポート白魔道士
#. de: Phantom-Weißmagier
#. fr: Mage blanc fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. White Mage
#. column 3: Attain mastery of restorative techniques with the soothing memories of a devoted white mage.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom White Mage:0"
msgid "Phantom White Mage"
msgstr "Призрачный белый маг"

#. ja: Ph. White Mage
#. de: Ph-Weißmagier
#. fr: Mage blanc fant.
#. column 0: Phantom White Mage
#. column 3: Attain mastery of restorative techniques with the soothing memories of a devoted white mage.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom White Mage:1"
msgid "Ph. White Mage"
msgstr "Призр. белый маг"

#. ja: ある白魔道士の献身と治癒の記憶。\n癒やしの力を生む白魔法のサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Hingabe und Aufopferung erfüllen diese Erinnerung eines alten Weißmagiers. Die darin enthaltenen Heiltechniken können sich zweifelsohne als überaus nützlich für die Expedition erweisen.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un mage blanc dévoué et expert en magie curative vous octroient la maîtrise de précieux sorts de soin.
#. column 0: Phantom White Mage
#. column 1: Ph. White Mage
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom White Mage:3"
msgid "Attain mastery of restorative techniques with the soothing memories of a devoted white mage."
msgstr "Овладейте целительными приёмами с помощью умиротворяющих воспоминаний преданного белого мага."

#. ja: サポート黒魔道士
#. de: Phantom-Schwarzmagier
#. fr: Mage noir fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Black Mage
#. column 3: Imbued with a black mage's dedicated research and experimentation, these recollections shall bestow unto you the arcane art of destruction.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Black Mage:0"
msgid "Phantom Black Mage"
msgstr "Призрачный чёрный маг"

#. ja: Ph. Black Mage
#. de: Ph-Schwarzmagier
#. fr: Mage noir fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Black Mage
#. column 3: Imbued with a black mage's dedicated research and experimentation, these recollections shall bestow unto you the arcane art of destruction.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Black Mage:1"
msgid "Ph. Black Mage"
msgstr "Призр. чёрный маг"

#. ja: ある黒魔道士の研究と検証の記憶。\n破壊の力を生む黒魔法のサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Das Leben eines Schwarzmagiers ist gefüllt mit Forschung und Experimenten, wie diese Erinnerung verrät. In ihrer Gefahr birgt die darin enthaltene zerstörerische Magie jedoch auch unvergleichliches positives Potenzial.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un mage noir dévoué à ses recherches vous octroient la maîtrise de sorts de magie élémentaire destructeurs.
#. column 0: Phantom Black Mage
#. column 1: Ph. Black Mage
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Black Mage:3"
msgid "Imbued with a black mage's dedicated research and experimentation, these recollections shall bestow unto you the arcane art of destruction."
msgstr "Воспоминания о кропотливых исследованиях и опытах чёрного мага откроют вам тайное искусство разрушения."

#. ja: サポート竜騎士
#. de: Phantom-Dragoon
#. fr: Chevalier dragon fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Dragoon
#. column 3: The memories of a trained dragoon's travels shall teach you to lunge and impale with impunity.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Dragoon:0"
msgid "Phantom Dragoon"
msgstr "Призрачный драгуна"

#. ja: Ph. Dragoon
#. de: Ph-Dragoon
#. fr: Chevalier drag. fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Dragoon
#. column 3: The memories of a trained dragoon's travels shall teach you to lunge and impale with impunity.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Dragoon:1"
msgid "Ph. Dragoon"
msgstr "Призр. драгуна"

#. ja: ある竜騎士の修験と遍歴の記憶。\n身軽に跳躍し敵を貫くサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Rigoroses Training und eiserne Entschlossenheit sind vonnöten, um sich dem Pfad des Dragoons zu verschreiben. Nur so lassen sich die flinken Bewegungstechniken und gewaltigen Sprünge meistern, die in dieser Erinnerung schlummern.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un chevalier dragon rompu aux combats vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions mêlant sauts et coups de lance mortels.
#. column 0: Phantom Dragoon
#. column 1: Ph. Dragoon
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Dragoon:3"
msgid "The memories of a trained dragoon's travels shall teach you to lunge and impale with impunity."
msgstr "Воспоминания о странствиях опытного драгуна научат вас стремительно бросаться вперёд и пронзать врагов."

#. ja: サポート召喚士
#. de: Phantom-Beschwörer
#. fr: Invocateur fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Summoner
#. column 3: Channel the reminiscences of an educated, practiced summoner and learn to call forth powerful creatures adept at both offense and defense.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Summoner:0"
msgid "Phantom Summoner"
msgstr "Призрачный призыватель"

#. ja: Ph. Summoner
#. de: Ph-Beschwörer
#. fr: Invocateur fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Summoner
#. column 3: Channel the reminiscences of an educated, practiced summoner and learn to call forth powerful creatures adept at both offense and defense.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Summoner:1"
msgid "Ph. Summoner"
msgstr "Призр. призыватель"

#. ja: ある召喚士の研究と実践の記憶。\n攻防に活躍する幻獣を喚び出すサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Beschwörer existieren im konstanten Wechsel zwischen Theorie und Praxis, was auch diese Erinnerung beweist. Die von ihnen gerufenen Familiare bieten sowohl offensive wie defensive Fähigkeiten, die in allerlei Situationen von Nutzen sind.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un invocateur passionné et expérimenté vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions d'invocation aussi efficaces en attaque qu'en défense.
#. column 0: Phantom Summoner
#. column 1: Ph. Summoner
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Summoner:3"
msgid "Channel the reminiscences of an educated, practiced summoner and learn to call forth powerful creatures adept at both offense and defense."
msgstr "Воспользуйтесь воспоминаниями об учёном и опытном призывателе, чтобы научиться вызывать могущественных существ, способных и атаковать, и защищать."

#. ja: サポート青魔道士
#. de: Phantom-Blaumagier
#. fr: Mage bleu fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Blue Mage
#. column 3: The memories of this world-weary sorcerer are tinged with deep paranoia. Access them to gain monstrous power in arcane form.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Blue Mage:0"
msgid "Phantom Blue Mage"
msgstr "Призрачный синий маг"

#. ja: Ph. Blue Mage
#. de: Ph-Blaumagier
#. fr: Mage bleu fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Blue Mage
#. column 3: The memories of this world-weary sorcerer are tinged with deep paranoia. Access them to gain monstrous power in arcane form.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Blue Mage:1"
msgid "Ph. Blue Mage"
msgstr "Призр. синий маг"

#. ja: ある呪い師の見聞と偏執の記憶。\n魔物の力を呪いとして用いるサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Fokus und Wissen machen einen wahren Blaumagier aus, wie diese Erinnerung offenbart. Die darin gespeicherten Techniken ermöglichen es, bestialische Fähigkeiten in mächtige Flüche zu verwandeln.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un mage bleu aventureux et curieux vous octroient la capacité d'apprendre des techniques des monstres rencontrés.
#. column 0: Phantom Blue Mage
#. column 1: Ph. Blue Mage
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Blue Mage:3"
msgid "The memories of this world-weary sorcerer are tinged with deep paranoia. Access them to gain monstrous power in arcane form."
msgstr "Воспоминания уставшего от мира чародея полны глубокой подозрительности. Обратитесь к ним, чтобы обрести чудовищную магическую силу."

#. ja: サポート赤魔道士
#. de: Phantom-Rotmagier
#. fr: Mage rouge fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Red Mage
#. column 3: These recollections of a witty wandering red mage will allow you to wield black and white magicks in perfect balance.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Red Mage:0"
msgid "Phantom Red Mage"
msgstr "Фантомный красный маг"

#. ja: Ph. Red Mage
#. de: Ph-Rotmagier
#. fr: Mage rouge fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Red Mage
#. column 3: These recollections of a witty wandering red mage will allow you to wield black and white magicks in perfect balance.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Red Mage:1"
msgid "Ph. Red Mage"
msgstr "Фант. красный маг"

#. ja: ある赤魔道士の放浪と機知の記憶。\n白黒の魔法を器用に扱うサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Aufgeweckt und ungebunden ist das Leben des Rotmagiers, so spricht diese Erinnerung. Ob Weiß- oder Schwarzmagie, im Repertoire dieser Zauberer findet sich eine passende Technik für jede Situation.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un mage rouge vagabond et vif d'esprit vous octroient la maîtrise de sorts de magie blanche et noire en parfaite harmonie.
#. column 0: Phantom Red Mage
#. column 1: Ph. Red Mage
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Red Mage:3"
msgid "These recollections of a witty wandering red mage will allow you to wield black and white magicks in perfect balance."
msgstr "Воспоминания об остроумном странствующем красном маге позволят вам в совершенстве владеть чёрной и белой магией."

#. ja: サポートネクロマンサー
#. de: Phantom-Nekromant
#. fr: Nécromancien fantôme
#. column 1: Ph. Necromancer
#. column 3: Tainted with the tenacity of a desecrated necromancer, these memories promise the power to fight beyond death.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Necromancer:0"
msgid "Phantom Necromancer"
msgstr "Фантомный некромант"

#. ja: Ph. Necromancer
#. de: Ph-Nekromant
#. fr: Nécromancien fant.
#. column 0: Phantom Necromancer
#. column 3: Tainted with the tenacity of a desecrated necromancer, these memories promise the power to fight beyond death.
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Necromancer:1"
msgid "Ph. Necromancer"
msgstr "Фант. некромант"

#. ja: ある死霊使いの冒涜と執念の記憶。\n死を超えて戦うサポートアクションを修得する。
#. de: Unheilig und rachsüchtig sind diese Erinnerungen eines alten Nekromanten, der mit verbotenen Methoden versuchte, dem Tod zu entrinnen. Doch schlummert gerade in solch schändlicher Kunst gewaltige Macht, die im Kampfe nützlich sein kann.
#. fr: Les réminiscences d'un nécromancien versé dans les disciplines occultes et profanatrices vous octroient la maîtrise d'actions dépassant les limites de la mort.
#. column 0: Phantom Necromancer
#. column 1: Ph. Necromancer
msgctxt "MKDSupportJob:Phantom Necromancer:3"
msgid "Tainted with the tenacity of a desecrated necromancer, these memories promise the power to fight beyond death."
msgstr "Воспоминания осквернённого некроманта пропитаны его неукротимой волей и обещают силу, позволяющую сражаться даже после смерти."
